\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Execution variability on shared A100 GPUs. (a) Radio p99 of a two-cell 273-PRB PUSCH pipeline against the MPS share of a co-running Qwen prefill class: one 16-token request (light) or eight 512-token requests (heavy). Lines connect run means, and bars span the runs. (b) Fraction of runs whose latency exceeds a multiple of its median: schedule construction on the host (1,200 periods), cross-GPU receiver pairs at the 4.5\nonbreakingspace ms scale on a Python and a partly native C++/CUDA path (1,000 and 300 radio slots), and the NeuralRx\xspace  kernel as a TensorRT graph (300 slots).}}{4}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
