\newlabel{fig:overall}{{5}{7}{\sys architecture for one release period. Steps: \NRx outcome (\ding {182}), outcome batch (\ding {183}), recovery retiming (\ding {184}), independent verification (\ding {185}), dispatch (\ding {186}), AI slot (\ding {187}), and completion marker (\ding {188}). The steps are drawn for the evaluated multi-GPU placement (b); the single-GPU placement (a) exchanges IQ, LLR, and TB buffers through CUDA IPC rings and uses the same steps. In (b), each TB comes from a different cell; cuPHY instance 0 owns TB1-TB3, instance 1 owns TB4 and TB5, and ellipses mark further TBs}{figure.caption.8}{}}
